Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.10,0:00:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, welcome to Unmute.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.46,0:00:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We believe that ideas don't appear in a chat box.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.82,0:00:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They happen when you're reading a Slack
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.70,0:00:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,conversation or browsing the web or watching a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.02,0:00:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,YouTube video or scrolling through Twitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.50,0:00:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Unmute lets you convert those thoughts, those ideas,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.38,0:00:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,into actions there and then itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.94,0:00:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,With press of a key, you can create new tasks,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.90,0:00:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,continue working on existing tasks, or
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.54,0:00:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,dictate anywhere across your Mac
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.38,0:00:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,you can think of Unmute like a pair of ears for your MacBook.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.58,0:00:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's try it out.
